{'symbol': 'RSG', 'date': '2022-05-19 09:04:00', 'title': 'REPUBLIC SERVICES NAMED TO 100 BEST CORPORATE CITIZENS LIST FOR 2022', 'text': "RANKING RECOGNIZES COMPANY'S ESG LEADERSHIP IN CLIMATE CHANGE, ENVIRONMENT AND GOVERNANCE PHOENIX , MAY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR, REPUBLIC SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: RSG) HAS BEEN NAMED TO 3BL MEDIA'S 100 BEST CORPORATE CITIZENS RANKING, RECOGNIZING OUTSTANDING ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) TRANSPARENCY AND PERFORMANCE AMONG THE 1,000 LARGEST U.S. PUBLIC COMPANIES. THE COMPANY IS RANKED 58TH OVERALL AND FIRST AMONG ITS PEERS IN THE ENVIRONMENTAL SERVICES INDUSTRY."}